## History

Run records live in `./history/` — one file per run, named `YYYY-MM-DD-<run-id>.md`.

Schema for each history entry (see root `CLAUDE.md` for the full description and exact YAML form):

- `date`: YYYY-MM-DD
- `run_id`: short identifier unique within this skill
- `skill`: skill name
- `actor`: agent name or "human"
- `outcome`: `success` | `partial` | `failure`
- `duration_min`: integer
- `proposed_delta`: free text describing a suggested change to SKILL.md/PROCESS.md, or "none"
- `status`: `open` | `applied` | `rejected`

The entry body is free-form prose: notes, links to artifacts, decisions.
